/* =========================================================================
   MATH KIDS ADVENTURE
   A playful preschool math game (ages 3-6).
   Single-file React prototype: menu, profiles, categories, difficulty,
   timer, 4 question types, scoring, rewards, leaderboard, dashboard,
   achievements, and settings — all backed by localStorage.
   ========================================================================= */

